    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the world of <strong>Endless Nights - Zombie Apocalypse</strong>, where you face well you guessed it - <i>&quot;Endless Nights&quot;</i> of thrilling, challenging, intense tests of survival through carnage that just wont quit! See if you have what it takes to be the Elite Survivor, the Primal Warrior, the best ENZA SOLDIER!<br><br>In this epic AAA quality 3rd person Zombie Shooter, it's not about just surviving from the dead- but from surviving battles against other living factions out there too! No camping in this game, you will be constantly hunted by several different types of the dead - &quot;Land and Air!&quot; Be sure to keep you sight on a swivel and trigger finger ready in this action packed one of a kind game mode!<br><br><strong>Endless Nights - Zombie Apocalypse</strong> Features many different game modes:<br><br>- 1v1 Deathmatch/Objective<br>- 4v4 Deathmatch/Objective<br>- 100 Player Battle Royale<br>- Ranked Tournaments <br><br>Some Additional Game Features Coming Soon:<br><br>- Weapon Customization (Custom Saved Builds)<br>- Crafting System (Weapon Upgrades)<br>And more",
